<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - SocGen ups United Biscuits.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SocGen ups United Biscuits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Biscuits Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at SocGen, analysts at the brokerage said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Analyst Carl Short at SocGen said he had been a seller of United Biscuits for some two years, during which it had halved in value, but there had been signs that conditions in the UK food manufacturing industry had begun to improve.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1/2p at 197-1/2 by 1224 GMT -- close to the low of 193p set on December 13, its lowest level for more than five years.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
